Precess←{
   ⍝ Adjusts star positions ⍵ for precession of equinoxes over interval ⍺
    x←CarTriplet ⍵
    tilt←Radian Data.AXITILT
    retilt←InclRotate tilt
    detilt←InclRotate-tilt
    precession←LongRotate-⍺×2×PI÷25800×Data.YRLENGTH
    rot←retilt+.×precession+.×detilt
    2 RaDecDist x+.×rot }
